===Etymology===
Ultimately {{onomatopoeic|en|title=a}} {{sound symbolic|en|nocap=1}} {{reduplication|en|nocap=1}}, 1538 as noun, 1660 as verb. Perhaps from a dialectal word or {{der|en|gmq|-}}/Scandinavian; compare {{cog|non|flim||lampoon, mockery}}.<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref>

